   "text": "He writes it in a notebook by the till. A name, an\namount, a date. Often just \"Sharma — 200\".\nSometimes not even that, because the queue is\nmoving.",
   "originalText": "He writes it in a notebook by the till. A name, an\namount, a date. Often just \"Sharma — 200\".\nSometimes not even that, because the queue is\nmoving.",
