   "text": "Sharma walks out. He has no copy, no receipt, no\nnumber on his phone. Neither man can prove what was\nwritten, and only one of them holds the pen.",
   "originalText": "Sharma walks out. He has no copy, no receipt, no\nnumber on his phone. Neither man can prove what was\nwritten, and only one of them holds the pen.",
