   "locked": false,
   "text": "~1.3 crore kirana stores in India (Invest India).\n95% of kirana transactions are under ₹200. Nobody\npublishes how much of it runs on udhaar — we could\nnot find a single credible figure.",
   "originalText": "~1.3 crore kirana stores in India (Invest India).\n95% of kirana transactions are under ₹200. Nobody\npublishes how much of it runs on udhaar — we could\nnot find a single credible figure.",
