   "text": "Who is about to pay and who is drifting. So he\nchases everyone the same way, or he chases nobody.\nSharma, who always pays on day 9, gets asked on day\n4 and feels accused. Patil, who has quietly gone 40\ndays, gets asked never.",
   "originalText": "Who is about to pay and who is drifting. So he\nchases everyone the same way, or he chases nobody.\nSharma, who always pays on day 9, gets asked on day\n4 and feels accused. Patil, who has quietly gone 40\ndays, gets asked never.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
