   "text": "saaras:v4 hears \"Sharma ko do sau udhaar\" in the\nmixed Hindi-English a shopkeeper actually speaks,\nover shop noise. bulbul:v3 reads the balance back.\n\nPowers step 2. This is the one place in the whole\nproduct where voice is not decoration — his hands\nare full and there is a queue.",
   "originalText": "saaras:v4 hears \"Sharma ko do sau udhaar\" in the\nmixed Hindi-English a shopkeeper actually speaks,\nover shop noise. bulbul:v3 reads the balance back.\n\nPowers step 2. This is the one place in the whole\nproduct where voice is not decoration — his hands\nare full and there is a queue.",
