   "locked": false,
   "text": "Holds each customer's rhythm and the shopkeeper's\nstanding rules — \"Patil is a daily wager, he pays\nafter the 10th, never chase him before that.\"\n\nPowers step 4. The rhythm is arithmetic; Cognee\nremembers the instructions and the links between\nthem.",
   "originalText": "Holds each customer's rhythm and the shopkeeper's\nstanding rules — \"Patil is a daily wager, he pays\nafter the 10th, never chase him before that.\"\n\nPowers step 4. The rhythm is arithmetic; Cognee\nremembers the instructions and the links between\nthem.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
