   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Generate it the night before: one shop, 60 udhaar\ncustomers, 6 months of entries and repayments, each\nwith a believable personal rhythm and a believable\ntail of people who drifted.\n\nThe arithmetic on top is real. The data under it is\nours and is labelled as ours on every screen.",
   "originalText": "Generate it the night before: one shop, 60 udhaar\ncustomers, 6 months of entries and repayments, each\nwith a believable personal rhythm and a believable\ntail of people who drifted.\n\nThe arithmetic on top is real. The data under it is\nours and is labelled as ours on every screen.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
