  },
  {
   "id": "text-a00100",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1514,
   "y": 2268.25,
   "width": 384.53999999999996,
   "height": 162.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e9ecef",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a00100",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 701,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updatedAt": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"Khatabook already does this.\" — One-sided. So is\nOkCredit, deliberately.\n\n\"Why would the customer confirm?\" — Because an\nunconfirmed entry is an accusation, and because he\ndoes not know his own total.\n\n\"Is this lending?\" — No. RBI's Digital Lending\nDirections bind Regulated Entities. A shopkeeper is\nnot one.",
   "originalText": "\"Khatabook already does this.\" — One-sided. So is\nOkCredit, deliberately.\n\n\"Why would the customer confirm?\" — Because an\nunconfirmed entry is an accusation, and because he\ndoes not know his own total.\n\n\"Is this lending?\" — No. RBI's Digital Lending\nDirections bind Regulated Entities. A shopkeeper is\nnot one.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text-a00101",
